Subject: Amphora builds on kiln's hyper-raft
Why: kiln holds one copy of each project, with one record of its changes (docs/vendoring.md): Amphora's hyper-raft pin moves to kiln's (e0613f52, a descendant of Amphora's d5d5f8f6) and its records of hyper-raft's changes become kiln's. Amphora's own change kiln lacked (the held count fed on ticks, CP-T1.8) is kiln's 0007; its Darwin FIFO change is hyper-rt's, which kiln builds from crates/kiln-rt, and its keying-material change (CP-T2.2) no Amphora crate calls

